  "title": "📽️One Prompt. Nine Images. Pure AI Cinema.📽️ · Chase AI Community",
  "text": "1\nCommunity\nClassroom\nCalendar\nMembers\nMap\nLeaderboards\nAbout\nChase AI Community\n1\n7\nChase Hannegan\n👑\nDec '25 • 🧠Lessons\n📽️One Prompt. Nine Images. Pure AI Cinema.📽️\nIn this video, I'm showing you a workflow that turns one prompt into a 3x3 grid of scenes - your entire AI video story visualized before you generate a single video. No more guessing if your shots will fit together. Plus I'm giving you a free custom GPT that acts as your personal director and walks you through every decision.\nCustom GPT: https://chatgpt.com/g/g-6949bdceb0348191a7918bc7db7d9cbc-ai-video-director-assistant\n10:25\nCinematographer AI — System Prompt.pdf\nPDF • 143kb\nLike\n107\n74 comments\nShow more comments\n2\nMatthew Lewis\n• Dec '25\nWow that’s amazing\n1\nReply\n1\nTommy Tung\n• Dec '25\nThis is great! Thank you!\n1\nReply\n2\nAi Wax\n• Dec '25\nHappy Holidays!! Looking forward to a healthy and happy New Year. Good luck to all and Enjoy!!!\n1\nReply\n1\nCerebric Tech\n• Dec '25\nthis was a great tutorial, and i saw there is a pdf too along with the costum gpt. where can i find it\n2\nReply\n1\nTejas Vyn\n• Dec '25\ncan I please get the system prompt that you talked about giving in the video?\n3\nReply\n1\nIaroslav Kerget\n• Dec '25\nHello, thanks! But I want to find out where I can find the entire system prompt?\n1\nReply\n1\nIaroslav Kerget\n• Dec '25\nFrom mobile page view you can't see prompt - but from Computer i can see it.\n1\nReply\n1\nGeorgy K\n• Dec '25\nThank you @Chase Hannegan\n0\nReply\n2\nLibis Bueno\n• Dec '25\n@Chase Hannegan I was inspired by your great video and awesome prompt generator so, I gave this a try. This is the result https://youtu.be/5Pt5z844qOQ?si=G8P6vjQ6EFLK8itd\n1:34\n3\nReply\n7\nChase Hannegan\n👑\n• Dec '25\n@Libis Bueno nice!\n0\nReply\n1\nYolanda V\n• Feb 6\n@Libis Bueno cool\n1\nReply\nView 1 more reply\n1\nJimmy Busto\n• Dec '25\nWe need an AI that can automatically add sound effects just by analyzing the video.\n2\nReply\n1\nX Z\n• Jan 3\nIt's really great.I only have a Gemini membership, how can I get the full set of prompts?\n2\nReply\n1\nJingjing Peng\n• Jan 4\nVery practical！Thank you！\n2\nReply\n1\nJiawei Gou\n• Jan 5\nths\n2\nReply\n1\nQiuqiu Huang\n• Jan 6\n可以给我提示词吗，谢谢\n2\nReply\n2\nMecko Chi\n• Jan 13\n@Qiuqiu Huang 你好\n0\nReply\n1\nQiuqiu Huang\n• Jan 6\n请问怎么可以获得提示词\n0\nReply\n2\nAnderson Barros\n• Jan 6\nExcellent tutorial, congratulations! Can you help me with a question? I'm stuck on this stage of the process. I generated the grid with the 9 images, but now I don't know how to generate the video for each scene separately. For reference when creating the video, do I need to have the images from the grid separated?\n2\nReply\n2\nSarfaraaz Shaikh\n• Jan 6\n@Anderson Barros lovely\n1\nReply\n2\nLibis Bueno\n• Jan 7\n@Anderson Barros all you have to do is take screenshot of the reference image in the grid. Make sure your grid images are in high resolution. That should do it.\n1\nReply\nView 1 more reply\n2\nDenys Rybchenko\n• Jan 7\nThis looks phenomenal! The only problem I'm facing is when I take a screenshot of each frame from the grid, the quality significantly drops..\nWondering if anybody has any workaround for this.\n2\nReply\n7\nChase Hannegan\n👑\n• Jan 7\n@Denys Rybchenko did you make the original in 4k\n1\nReply\n2\nDenys Rybchenko\n• Jan 7\n@Chase Hannegan You're right! I have 2k max available only with my subscription 🙈\n1\nReply\nView 2 more replies\n1\nJoakim Branting\n• Jan 7\nMaybe if you make 9 copys of the original and then just crop them all for each individual image and the quality wont be as affected? Just an idea! (have not tried it)\n2\nReply\n2\nSarfaraaz Shaikh\n• Jan 12 (edited)\nNano Banana pro to generate Super Villain\n1\nReply\n2\nMecko Chi\n• Jan 13\nThis is the reason I always watch your tutorial.\n1\nReply\n2\nMecko Chi\n• Jan 13\nYou damn good\n1\nReply\n1\nMostafa Abozid\n• Feb 4\nI need videos that will help me create videos about life in -70 degrees Celsius, like the Ffamily advent channel. Can anyone help me?\n0\nReply\n1\nFrank Niehorster\n• 22d\nNice thank you\n0\nReply\n1\nStephy Calkie\n• 17d\nThanks Chase, exactly what i was looking for!\n0\nReply\n1\nFrancesco Alemanno\n• 3d\nThanks a lot Chase, you’re the man! 🙏🏻 I’ve a problem, Image upload fails when I try to add in this GPT, you know how can I fix it?\n0\nReply\n1\n\n\n\n\n7\n📽️One Prompt. Nine Images. Pure AI Cinema.📽️\nChase AI Community\nskool.com/chase-ai-community\nGo from learning to earning. Join Chase AI+👇\nUpgrade to Chase AI+\n57.5k\nMembers\n245\nOnline\n3\nAdmins\nINVITE PEOPLE\nLeaderboard (30-day)\n1\nVitalii Hryhorenko\n+51\n2\nCharles Dove\n🔥\n+23\n3\nCyber Ai\n+22\n4\nSam Alder\n🔥\n+16\n5\nJonathan Wilson\n+15\nSee all leaderboards\nPowered by",
